export const GSA_ZH_ITEM_DESCS = {"Summon one selected SR character. (Standard Summon Characters: Aira, Denice, Vera, Mudia, Yulia, Lin Lan, Takajou Ranka, Katya, Thalia)": "指定召募1名SR角色。（一般召募角色：艾拉、丹妮絲、維菈、穆蒂雅、尤莉亞、凌嵐、高城 嵐花、卡緹亞、塔莉亞）", "[Title] As you seize the treasure of the abyss, the abyss seizes your conscience.": "【稱號】奪取深淵的財寶，深淵也在奪取你的良知。", "Use to summon the SSR character: Li Mu.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『李沐』。", "A Lunar Splendor Crest. Carrying this emblem in Moonflower territory can help you avoid some trouble. Obtained through events, it can be exchanged for items at the Exchange Shop. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "月之華徽記，在月華組的地盤身帶此徽記，可避免一些麻煩。透過活動取得，可於交易所兌換商品。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "Obtained through Packs and the [Lunar Splendor of the Pleasure District] Armament Resupply Chest. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "透過禮包與【繁華遊廓的月之華】武裝補給箱取得。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "Who is pressed against Belle's back?": "是誰抵在貝兒的身後？", "Supports versatile combat roles, designed for high-stress environments.": "支援複合型態作戰，適用於高壓環境。", "Obtained through Packs and the [War & Music] Armament Resupply Chest. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "透過禮包與【戰爭與音樂】武裝補給箱取得。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "Open to choose a Shimmering Special Gem, Tap the icon to preview the item's contents.": "開啟後可自行選擇一顆閃耀的特殊寶石，點擊圖示可預覽道具內容。", "One of the laboratory's materials. An application of the most cutting-edge biotechnology of the era.": "實驗室的材料之一。時代最尖端的生物科技應用。", "An exquisitely crafted lace handkerchief with a delicate floral pattern embroidered in the corner. It symbolizes her elegant appearance and flawless image. (Connie's Affection +1000)": "做工精緻的蕾絲手帕，角落繡有細緻花紋。象徵她優雅外表與完美的形象。（昆妮好感度+1000）", "Garmr Treasure Mine Event , 1st Place Reward.": "『加姆寶礦』活動排名No.1獎勵。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Annabelle</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR安娜貝爾</color>提升星等。", "Randomly obtain 1 Specialized Stain-Resistant Armor.": "隨機獲得1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級抗汙防具。", "Supports versatile frontline breakthrough operations, suitable for high-intensity mission environments.": "支援複合型態前線突破行動，適用於高強度任務環境。", "VIP 5 Exclusive Pack: Limited Portrait Frame.": "『VIP5專屬禮包』限定頭像框。", "Can be used to summon 10 Perfect Ladies from Heaven's Door. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "可召募十次天堂之門的完美女性。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Milena</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR米蓮娜</color>提升星等。", "Beat it.": "「滾吧。」", "Issued by the Tobia government, this is the most common currency used for trade.": "由托比亞政府發行，是最常見的交易貨幣。", "A fragment of a standard rhombic crystal produced through quantum entanglement. Collecting a certain amount allows you to synthesize a standard rhombic crystal.": "透過量子糾纏產生的普通菱晶體的碎片。集齊一定數量可以合成普通菱晶體。", "After nightfall, the pleasure district overflows with alcohol and sex. This is a playground for adults only.": "入夜後花街充滿酒精與性愛，這裡是屬於成人的街道。", "To make sure that nothing like the Saint Violet's Tragedy ever happens again...": "「為了讓悲劇……讓聖紫羅蘭慘案——不再重演。」", "Use to summon the SSR character: Bernardo.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『貝爾納多』。", "EROLABS Coin": "Erolabs幣", "A bouquet of white lilies in a clear glass vase. The petals are flawless, subtly revealing yellow-orange stamens at their center, all set against a backdrop of green leaves. Pure and elegant, it is the perfect gift for someone you cherish. (Annabelle's Affection +1000)": "插在透明玻璃瓶中的白色百合花束。花瓣無瑕,花心微露黃橙蕊心,綠葉襯托。純淨、優雅,適合贈予重視之人。（安娜貝爾好感度+1000）", "A rare material used for crafting high-tier equipment.": "製造高階裝備的稀有素材。", "Even the utmost luxury cannot escape the ravages of war.": "極致的奢華，也逃不過戰火的摧殘。", "A small quantity of high-quality triangular crystals produced through quantum entanglement. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的少量高優質三角晶體，在精煉過程中進行多次檢測與修正，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "Launch Event Limited Portrait Frame": "上市活動限定頭像框。", "Open to receive either Gold, Gem Fragments, or Rough Gems. Tap the icon to preview the item's contents.": "開啟後可隨機獲得金幣、寶石碎屑、或是粗糙的寶石其中一種，點擊圖示可預覽道具內容。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Ruo Lan</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR若蘭</color>提升星等。", "A curated skincare gift set from a cosmetic brand, containing a variety of popular and effective skincare products. Each item is presented in elegant and unique packaging. (Affection +500)": "美妝品牌推出的精選護膚禮盒，內含多款人氣高效的護膚品，每件單品以優雅獨特的包裝呈現。（好感度+500）", "Enhances explosive impact force. Contains an intermediate-level explosive core component.": "強化爆破衝擊力，內含中級爆破核心元件。", "The suffocating, oppressive love of a witch. Obtainable from the event; can be used to exchange for items at the Exchange Shop. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "窒息壓迫的魔女的愛。透過活動關卡取得，可於交易所兌換商品。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "Use to select and receive a Combat Style Module (Lv. 4). Receive 50 per use.": "自選獲得戰鬥風格模組（Lv4）。每次可獲得50個。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Qingyin</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR清音</color>提升星等。", "Washed completely clean, from the inside out.": "從裡到外都被清洗得一乾二淨。", "Use to summon the SSR character: Kurosawa Shion.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『黑澤 詩音』。", "Fuses an all-domain tactical simulation system with a real-time response master core, designed for top-secret combat units.": "融合全領域戰術推演系統與即時反應主控核心，為最高機密等級突擊作戰單位打造。", "Character Selector Ticket. Can be used for 10 Summons. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "指定角色召募卡，可召募10次。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "Suitable for beginner combat, teaches the fundamentals of basic assault.": "適用於新手作戰，學習初級突擊要領。", "Heaven's Door Event , 1st Place Reward.": "『天堂之門』活動排名No.1獎勵。", "Use to select and receive a Combat Style Module (Lv. 2). Receive 5 per use.": "自選獲得戰鬥風格模組（Lv2）。每次可獲得5個。", "Randomly obtain 1 Specialized Photochromic Armor.": "隨機獲得1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級光變色防具。", "A small quantity of high-quality cluster crystals produced through quantum entanglement. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的少量高優質叢狀晶體，在精煉過程中進行多次檢測與修正，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Elena</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR伊蓮娜</color>提升星等。", "Soft cake drenched in smooth toffee sauce and finished with a sprinkle of toasted almonds. The savory-sweet notes and nutty fragrance offer a gentle comfort with every mouthful. It's a dreamlike confection that melts away even the darkest moods. (Ojima Erina's Affection +1000)": "香滑太妃糖醬淋在柔軟蛋糕上，表層撒上烤杏仁和堅果，甜味中帶著微鹹與堅果香氣。每一口都像被溫柔擁抱。是連心情都能被暖化的夢幻蛋糕。（小島 繪里奈好感度+1000）", "Fuses a tactical firing simulation architecture with a battlefield analysis command core, designed for top-secret sniper combat units.": "融合戰術射擊預演架構與戰場分析主控核心，為最高機密等級狙擊作戰單位打造。", "Event Summon Ticket. Can be used for 10 Summons. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "期間召募卡，可召募10次。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "Use to summon the SSR character: Hijikata Chizuru.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『土方 千鶴』", "Use to select and receive a Combat Style Module (Lv. 2). Receive 50 per use.": "自選獲得戰鬥風格模組（Lv2）。每次可獲得50個。", "Countless passionate memories of youth seem to linger here still.": "無數的熱血青春，彷彿還在此地殘留著。", "Forged in fine wine, fresh blood, and bullets, that's a style born of unyielding resilience.": "在美酒、鮮血與子彈中淬煉而生的，是堅忍不拔的格調。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Chloe</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR克蘿伊</color>提升星等。", "A high-quality star crystal produced through quantum entanglement, featuring high purity and a smooth crystal surface. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的優質星晶體，純度高、晶體表面平滑，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "Under the dim lights, it's the perfect place to entertain partners and enemies alike.": "昏暗的燈光下，非常適合招待合作夥伴或敵人。", "A contract issued to top-tier headhunters. Can be used for 1 Summon.": "委託專業人資獵才，可召募1次。", "Choose 100 Energy Module from the 6 elements.": "從6種屬性中，指定選擇100個能量模塊。", "Obtained in the Heaven's Door event; can be exchanged for rewards. (Will be recalled after the event ends)": "在天堂之門活動中取得，可兌換獎勵。（活動結束後回收）", "Choose 1 <color=#F7AFFD>Specialized</color> Cooling Armor.": "指定選擇1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級涼感防具。", "Utilizing advanced technology, multiple emerald chips are integrated into a single module device that enhances performance when synchronized with other modules. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過先進科技將多個綠寶石晶片整合為模組裝置，與其他模組同步運作增強效能。可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "Choose 1 <color=#F7AFFD>Specialized</color> Stain-Resistant Armor.": "指定選擇1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級抗汙防具。", "Theodore's Stamina.": "西奧多的體力。", "Limited Character Summon Ticket. Can be used for 1 Summon. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "限定角色召募卡，可召募1次。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "Lunar Splendor of the Pleasure District Limited Profile Frame.": "『繁華遊廓的月之華』限定頭像框。", "Integrates an advanced detection database to enhance weak point identification and ballistic correction calculations.": "整合高階偵測資料庫，強化弱點辨識與彈道修正運算。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Clumsy Cowgirl - Belle</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR迷糊乳牛-貝兒</color>提升星等。", "Obtained from Wind Resonance stages. Can be exchanged for items at the Exchange Shop.": "透過風屬性共鳴關卡取得，可於交易所中兌換商品。", "Fresh tea leaves hand-picked at dawn from the valleys of a distant Eastern land. Features a clear infusion and elegant aroma. A refreshing treat for the mind and spirit. (Komachi Sayaka's Affection +1000)": "來自遙遠東方國度，山谷晨露初摘的新茶，湯色清亮，香氣高雅，飲之令人心曠神怡。（小町 咲香好感度+1000）", "Obtained by performing the [Amber Targeted Summon]. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "進行【安柏指定召募】取得。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "Use to summon the SR character: Thalia.": "使用後可召募SR角色：『塔莉亞』。", "Randomly obtain 1 Specialized Heat-Resistant Armor.": "隨機獲得1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級耐熱防具。", "Obtained by performing the [Lin Lin Targeted Summon]. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "進行【鈴鈴指定召募】取得。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "Use to summon the SSR character: Alyna.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『艾琳娜』。", "This, and this alone, I can never forgive.": "「惟有此事，不能原諒。」", "Use to summon the SSR character: Shiraishi Ai.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『白石 愛』。", "Wishing Powder refined from gemstones. Can be used to upgrade the Elemental Altar.": "從寶石中淬鍊出來的祈願之粉，可用於提升元素祭壇的等級。", "Raw rubies are natural, unprocessed products with powerful potential. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "紅寶石原石是未經加工的自然產物，擁有強大的潛能。可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "An ordinary yet beautiful day, where the passage of time fades away in the stillness of the deep night.": "平凡且美好的一天，在夜闌人靜裡淡忘時間流逝。", "Use to summon the SSR character: Amelie.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『愛蜜莉』。", "A standard star crystal produced through quantum entanglement, which has undergone a high-pressure sealing treatment. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的普通星晶體，但經過高壓密封處理，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "A perfect cluster crystal produced through quantum entanglement. It is crafted with the highest-spec techniques, resulting in minimal parameter variation. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的完美叢狀晶體，以最高規格工藝製成，參數變異極小，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "Reading the online reviews, you can only use your imagination to piece together that peak, love-struck experience.": "網路心得分享，你只能靠著想像意會那種充滿戀愛感的極致體驗。", "Use to summon the SR character: Yulia.": "使用後可召募SR角色：『尤莉亞』。", "Choose one piece of <color=#F7AFFD>Specialized</color> SSR Character Exclusive Handwear. (Standard Summon Characters: Ruo Lan, Kurosawa Shion, Chloe, Charlotte, Milena, Amelie, Annabelle, Sugimoto Arina, Ogino Rui, Lin Lin, Liz, Li Mu)": "指定選擇1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級SSR角色專屬手套。（一般召募角色：若蘭、黑澤 詩音、克蘿伊、夏洛特、米蓮娜、愛蜜莉、安娜貝爾、杉本 有菜、荻野 瑠衣、鈴鈴、莉茲、李沐）", "A contract issued to top-tier headhunters. Can be used for 1 Advanced Summon.": "委託專業人資獵才，進行1次精英召募。", "A byproduct of a failed experiment. Can be exchanged for items at the Exchange Shop": "實驗失敗的產物，可於交易所兌換商品。", "Utilizing advanced technology, a ruby is controlled by a microchip to achieve a stable amplification effect. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過先進科技將紅寶石以微晶片控制，達到穩定增幅的效果。可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "Experience needed to level up a character.": "角色提升等級需要的經驗值。", "Welcome to Elysium. All that is a feast for the eyes, the nose, and the palate belongs to me. If you did not know before, you certainly do now.": "歡迎來到極樂世界，凡色香味俱全者皆我所有。若你先前不曉得，現在總知道了。", "A record of basic training used to enhance combat skills. Can be used to quickly increase a character's EXP by {0}. When a character reaches max level, any excess EXP is refunded.": "基礎訓練記錄，強化實戰能力。能夠快速提升角色{0}經驗值。角色升級至滿等，返還溢出之經驗值。", "To avoid being swallowed by the abyss of mortal desires, one must first master every depth of them.": "為了不被七情六慾的深淵吞噬，必須先熟悉它。", "Raw sapphires are natural, unprocessed products with powerful potential. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "藍寶石原石是未經加工的自然產物，擁有強大的潛能。可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Komachi Sayaka</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR小町 咲香</color>提升星等。", "Echoing Melody Limited Profile Frame.": "『音行自鳴』限定頭像框。", "Increases the number of [Elemental Resonance] attempts by 1.": "可增加1次【屬性共鳴】次數。", "A perfect rhombic crystal produced through quantum entanglement. It is crafted with the highest-spec techniques, resulting in minimal parameter variation. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的完美菱晶體，以最高規格工藝製成，參數變異極小，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "Immediately restores 30 Stamina.": "立即恢復30點體力。", "Use to select and receive a Combat Style Module (Lv. 1). Receive 5 per use.": "自選獲得戰鬥風格模組（Lv1）。每次可獲得5個。", "A curated selection of the trendiest cute accessories, from Korean-style hair clips to designer mini brooches. With this box in hand, you'll instantly become a walking fashion icon. (Ogino Rui's Affection +1000)": "精選當下最夯的可愛飾品，從韓系髮夾到設計師迷你胸針，一盒在手即刻變身行走的時尚ICON。（荻野 瑠衣好感度+1000）", "Can be used to summon a Perfect Lady from Heaven's Door. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "可召募一次天堂之門的完美女性。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "Struggling artists must always find ways to reinvent themselves just to survive.": "人氣不高的藝人，總要想辦法轉型生存。", "Randomly obtain 1 Specialized Cooling Armor.": "隨機獲得1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級涼感防具。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Liz</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR莉茲</color>提升星等。", "Rank 50 Reward.": "Rank50獎勵。", "Restrained desire runs high in the dead of night.": "緊縛的情慾在深夜高漲。", "Obtained by performing the [Chloe Targeted Summon]. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "進行【克蘿伊指定召募】取得。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "Use to select and receive a Combat Style Module (Lv. 6). Receive 5 per use.": "自選獲得戰鬥風格模組（Lv6）。每次可獲得5個。", "Obtained by performing the [Liz Targeted Summon]. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "進行【莉茲指定召募】取得。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "In the empty warehouse, a scent of rust lingers, a remnant of violence.": "空蕩蕩的倉庫裡面，飄盪著一股鐵鏽味，是一場暴力遺留的。", "Obtained by performing the [Rachel Targeted Summon]. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "進行【瑞秋指定召募】取得。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "An ordinary yet beautiful day, quietly observing the passage of time amidst gentle breezes and bright sunshine.": "平凡且美好的一天，在風和日麗中靜觀時間流逝。", "Utilizing advanced technology, a sapphire is controlled by a microchip to achieve a stable amplification effect. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過先進科技將藍寶石以微晶片控制，達到穩定增幅的效果。可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "Please be a little rougher.": "請再亂暴ㄧ些。", "Use to summon the SSR character: Awana.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『沫沫』。", "Supports versatile long-range missions, suitable for high-risk battlefields with frequent environmental changes.": "支援複合遠程任務，適用於高風險、環境變動頻繁之戰場。", "Use to summon the SSR character: Rookie Maid - Sugimoto Arina": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『新手女僕-杉本 有菜』。", "Use to summon the SSR character: Clumsy Cowgirl - Belle.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『迷糊乳牛-貝兒』。", "If I wear a mask, no one will recognize me, right?": "戴著面具，就不會被認出來了吧？", "A high-quality cubic crystal produced through quantum entanglement, featuring high purity and a smooth crystal surface. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的優質方晶體，純度高、晶體表面平滑，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "Open to select and receive 1 Specialized-Grade Accessory. Tap to preview contents.": "開啟後可自選獲得1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>等級飾品。點擊可預覽內容。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up<color=#e88418>SSR Fujiwara Shiyoi</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR藤原 紫宵</color>提升星等。", "But what matters most, is the Carducci honor you threw away.": "「最重要的是——卡迪久家族那被你遺棄的榮耀。」", "Randomly obtain 1 Specialized Low-Maintenance Armor.": "隨機獲得1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級免洗耐用防具。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Leng Zhen</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR冷鴆</color>提升星等。", "Open to randomly receive 1 Specialized-Grade Accessory. Tap to preview contents.": "開啟後可隨機獲得1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>等級飾品。點擊可預覽內容。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Sugimoto Arina</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR杉本 有菜</color>提升星等。", "Event Summon Ticket. Can be used for 1 Summon. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "期間召募卡，可召募1次。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "A small quantity of high-quality rhombic crystals produced through quantum entanglement. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的少量高優質菱晶體，在精煉過程中進行多次檢測與修正，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "A notebook with a refined yet understated leather cover. Beyond just the scent of leather and paper, it still carries a lingering trace of your fragrance. (Chloe's Affection +1000)": "低調又有質感的皮製封面的筆記本，上面除了皮革與紙張的味道外，還殘留著你的味道。（ 克蘿伊好感度+1000）", "Enhances durability and stability. Contains an intermediate-level core component.": "強化耐久性與穩定性，內含中級核心元件。", "Contains a thermal-energy conductive layer that, when applied, promotes muscle recovery and regulates breathing. It soothes stiffness and fatigue in the neck and shoulders, allowing Shiraishi Ai to enjoy a moment of gentle care even while tending to others. (Shiraishi Ai's Affection +1000)": "內含有熱能型異能導層，在貼附後促進肌肉修復和氣息穩定，舒緩肩頸僵硬與疲憊，讓白石愛在細心照顧他人之餘也能享受片刻溫柔呵護。（白石 愛好感度+1000）", "A seemingly ordinary street bustling with commuters, yet it can hardly conceal its decadent nature.": "通勤族來往，尋常不過的街道，卻難以隱藏其淫靡的本質。", "Harvesting the Yin to nourish the Yang is the ultimate secret to eternal youth and vitality.": "採陰補陽就是延年益壽的養生之道。", "Bringing a classic back to the big screen. This ticket can be redeemed for a special screening of a nostalgic martial arts film, allowing one to relive the golden age of action movies. (Li Mu's Affection +1000)": "昔日經典重現大銀幕，這張欣賞票可兌換一場懷舊武打電影專場，讓人回味動作片黃金年代。（李沐好感度+1000）", "A finely bound hardcover book that appears to have a long history. For any bibliophile, regardless of its contents, a cover this exquisite holds immense value as a collectible on its own. (Alyna's Affection +1000)": "一本看上去歷史悠久的精裝書。對於書痴而言，姑且不論內容，光是封面如此精緻就有很高的收藏價值。（艾琳娜好感度+1000）", "Integrates an advanced assault tactics database to enhance formation breaking and combat rhythm sensing capabilities.": "整合高階突擊戰術資料庫，強化破陣與搏擊節奏感應能力。", "A high-tech fragrance diffuser with a cute design. By releasing a high-concentration, mood-guiding scent, it creates a comfortable and even slightly psychedelic atmosphere...": "造型甜美，高科技的香氛擴散裝置。透過施放的高濃度情緒引導香氛，營造舒適、甚至輕微迷幻的空間氛圍……", "An exquisite set of pink charms that makes you feel cute just by holding it. Although Kana already has many, there's always room for one more adorable charm. (Andou Kana's Affection +1000)": "一個精緻的粉色吊飾組，光是拿著都讓人感覺變可愛了。雖然加奈已經有了很多，但可愛的小東西永遠差你手上這個。（安藤 加奈好感度+1000）", "A collection of rare samples featuring symptoms observed in experimental or clinical cases of abnormality. Can be used directly for comparative research, and even includes original data from extreme cases related to Lucien. (Kurosawa Shion's Affection +1000)": "收錄罕見實驗中或臨床異變症狀的樣本。能直接用於交叉比對研究，甚至包含路西恩有關的極端病例原始資料。（黑澤 詩音好感度+1000）", "A gift exclusively for you, wishing only to serve you.": "只屬於你的禮物，只願為你服務。", "Default Emoji.": "預設表情貼。", "Use to summon the SSR character: Ogino Rui.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『荻野 瑠衣』。", "Use to select and receive an Elemental Cluster. Receive 1 per use.": "自選獲得屬性晶簇。每次可獲得1個。", "Obtained from Earth Resonance stages. Can be exchanged for items at the Exchange Shop.": "透過土屬性共鳴關卡取得，可於交易所中兌換商品。", "An aged red wine from a renowned winery with a smooth, mellow flavor that isn't the least bit astringent. Even with money, it's not always possible to obtain. For a connoisseur, it's a rare and coveted treasure. (Victoria's Affection +1000)": "來自知名酒莊的陳年紅酒，口感香醇不酸澀，即便有錢也不一定買的到。對行家而言，這是不可多得的夢幻逸品。（維多莉亞好感度+1000）", "May every day you spend in Tobia be filled with hope, dreams, and... love.": "「願你在托比亞的每一天，都能感受到希望、夢想，還有……愛。」", "Use to summon the SR character: Lin Lan.": "使用後可召募SR角色：『凌嵐』。", "Finely woven from the highest quality merino wool. The understated color and exquisite craftsmanship make it both lightweight and warm, perfect for missions or everyday wear. (Adele's Affection +1000)": "以頂級美麗諾羊毛精細編織而成。低調色澤搭配精緻手藝，輕盈保暖；不論是任務中或是平時打扮都非常適合。（艾黛爾好感度+1000）", "Enhances stability and continuous recovery efficiency. Contains an intermediate-level restoration module.": "強化穩定性與持續回復效率，內含中級復原模組。", "A standard cubic crystal produced through quantum entanglement, which has undergone a high-pressure sealing treatment. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的普通方晶體，但經過高壓密封處理，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "Use to summon the SSR character: Fujiwara Arisa.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『藤原 亞璃紗』。", "Integrates comprehensive defense data to support consciousness-level combat units.": "整合全方位防護資料，支援意識級作戰單位。", "Obtained by performing the [Kurosawa Shion Targeted Summon]. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "進行【黑澤 詩音指定召募】取得。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "Choose 1 <color=#F7AFFD>Specialized</color> Retroreflective Armor.": "指定選擇1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級逆反射防具。", "Suitable for beginners to learn basic defense techniques.": "適用於新手，學習初級防護。", "A high-density, high-quality cluster crystal produced through quantum entanglement. It is synthesized under specific conditions and possesses a high energy density. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的高密度優質叢狀晶體，在特定條件下合成，具有高能量密度，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "Music, alcohol, bodies, you can find the night you crave most in VORTEX.": "音樂、酒精、肉體，在VORTEX能找到最想要的夜晚。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Connie</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR昆妮</color>提升星等。", "Bright scenery filled with the sweet scent of green grass, nurturing bonds of deep intimacy.": "明媚風光，飄盪著青草的芬芳，孕育各種親密的情誼。", "Use to summon the SR character: Takajou Ranka.": "使用後可召募SR角色：『高城 嵐花』。", "A Phone Battery. You'll need this to stay in touch with the lovely ladies.": "手機電量。想要與曼妙的女子聯繫，都得依靠它。", "Randomly obtain 1 Specialized Silver Ion Armor.": "隨機獲得1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級銀離子防具。", "A standard spherical crystal produced through quantum entanglement, which has undergone a high-pressure sealing treatment. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的普通球狀晶體，但經過高壓密封處理，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "[Standard Summon] Use to randomly Summon one SSR character from the Standard Summon.": "【一般召募】使用後可隨機召募一名一般召募中的SSR角色。", "Never casually experiment with the pleasure of asphyxiation.": "千萬不要隨便嘗試窒息的快感。", "An exquisite, transparent glass piano with delicate and elegant carvings on its lid. When the music box is activated, its pure melody gently soothes the heart. (Jessica's Affection +1000)": "外型精緻透明玻璃鋼琴，琴蓋上刻有細緻優雅的雕花紋路。當音樂盒啟動時，純淨的旋律溫柔撫慰著內心。（潔西卡好感度+1000）", "Use to select and receive a Combat Style Module (Lv. 4). Receive 5 per use.": "自選獲得戰鬥風格模組（Lv4）。每次可獲得5個。", "Daytime in Tobia carries a hint of exhaustion after the revelry, and a sense of melancholy is hidden in its corners.": "托比亞的白天，帶著一絲狂歡後的力竭，以及暗藏在角落裡的憂鬱。", "A standard triangular crystal produced through quantum entanglement, which has undergone a high-pressure sealing treatment. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的普通三角晶體，但經過高壓密封處理，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "A perfect cubic crystal produced through quantum entanglement. It is crafted with the highest-spec techniques, resulting in minimal parameter variation. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的完美方晶體，以最高規格工藝製成，參數變異極小，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "[Recreation Club] If you wish to continue, use this ticket for an extra attempt.": "【娛樂會館】若意猶未盡，可花費此票券額外遊玩一次。", "Desperate Deathmatch Weekly Rank 1 Reward": "『絕命武鬥會』週排名No.1獎勵。", "Integrates a battlefield visual prediction system and a long-range perception module to support ultra-long-range precision shooting.": "整合戰場視覺預測系統與長距離感知模組，支援超長距離精確射擊。", "Open to randomly receive 1 Standard-Grade Accessory. Tap to preview contents.": "開啟後可隨機獲得1件<color=#BAD98D>制式</color>等級飾品。點擊可預覽內容。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Alyna</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR艾琳娜</color>提升星等。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Ogino Rui</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR荻野 瑠衣</color>提升星等。", "Maintain focus and vigilance. Meet both triumph and disaster with humility and calm. Obtained from Investigation Stages. Can be exchanged for items at the Exchange Shop.": "保持專注警戒，面對勝敗皆要謙遜沉著。透過調查關卡取得，可於交易所兌換商品。", "A heart of benevolence, healing the world with miraculous skills. Obtained from Investigation Stages. Can be exchanged for items at the Exchange Shop.": "仁心德術，懸壺濟世，妙手回春。透過調查關卡取得，可於交易所兌換商品。", "Emerald granules that have the property of slightly enhancing Esper abilities. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "綠寶石顆粒擁有小幅強化異能的特性。可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "The sound spreads, vast and ethereal; the curse binds, deep in a dark prison. Obtainable from the event; can be used to exchange for items at the Exchange Shop. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "音衍太虛渺，蠱縛幽牢深。透過活動取得，可於交易所兌換商品。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "Use to summon the SR character: Mudia.": "使用後可召募SR角色：『穆蒂雅』。", "A high-quality spherical crystal produced through quantum entanglement, featuring high purity and a smooth crystal surface. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的優質球狀晶體，純度高、晶體表面平滑，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "A fragment used to craft Forged Steel.": "可製造鍛鋼的碎片。", "[Recreation Club] Only those who have proven their luck through the Lucky Wheel may enter the President's Secret Club.": "【娛樂會館】只有受到通過幸運滾輪證明自己的幸運兒，才能夠進入會長的秘密會館。", "Use to select and receive a Combat Style Module (Lv. 5). Receive 50 per use.": "自選獲得戰鬥風格模組（Lv5）。每次可獲得50個。", "Go to hell...!": "「下地獄去吧……！」", "A reward obtained from the Rampage Experiment. Can be exchanged for items at the Exchange Shop.": "在暴走實驗室取得的獎賞。可於交易所兌換商品。", "Obtained by exchanging an SSR Medallion. Can be used to redeem a character at the SSR Talent Agency.": "透過『SSR等級掛牌』兌換取得，可於交易所的『SSR人才介紹所』兌換角色。", "A powerful emerald Esper device created with advanced technology. It contains a large, flawless emerald and a control module, and can stably amplify Esper abilities several-fold. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過先進科技製造的強大的綠寶石異能裝置。內部有一個大型完美綠寶石與控制模組。能將異能穩定地增幅高達數倍，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "The faint fragrance lingering inside still recalls the intimate entanglement of that night's bath.": "殘留在裡頭的暗暗芬芳，還能想起那晚的共浴纏綿。", "Suitable for beginner support training, teaches basic assist and recovery skills.": "適用於新手支援訓練，學習初級輔助與回復功能。", "A badge from a traditional card game popular in the territory of the Moonflower Clan. Obtained through event stage, it can be exchanged for items at the Exchange Shop. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "流行於月華組地盤的傳統紙牌遊戲勳章。透過活動關卡取得，可於交易所兌換商品。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "All living things are but materials; souls scattered and spirits broken into servitude. Obtainable from the event; can be used to exchange for items at the Exchange Shop. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "眾生為材，銷魂散魄成奴。透過活動關卡取得，可於交易所兌換商品。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "Advanced training record that combines theory and practical experience. Can be used to quickly increase a character's EXP by {0}.": "進階訓練紀錄，結合理論與實戰經驗。能夠快速提升角色{0}經驗值。", "Default Profile Picture.": "預設頭像。", "Utilizing advanced technology, multiple ruby chips are integrated into a single module device that enhances performance when synchronized with other modules. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過先進科技將多個紅寶石晶片整合為模組裝置，與其他模組同步運作增強效能。可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "Immediately restores 10 Stamina.": "立即恢復10點體力。", "Use to summon the SSR character: Amber.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『安柏』。", "Behind the glitz and glamour of an idol lies a world of unseen hardships.": "偶像光鮮亮麗的背後，是不為人知的辛酸。", "Randomly obtain 1 Specialized Accessory.": "隨機獲得1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級飾品。", "Use to randomly summon one SSR character: Elena or Victoria.": "使用後可隨機召募一名SSR角色：『伊蓮娜』或『維多莉亞』。", "A small quantity of high-quality spherical crystals produced through quantum entanglement. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的少量高優質球狀晶體，在精煉過程中進行多次檢測與修正，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "[Title] A Nobody": "【稱號】無名小卒", "Use to summon the SSR character: Victoria.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『維多莉亞』。", "Integrates an advanced medical database to enhance tactical signal diffusion and command coordination capabilities.": "整合高階醫療資料庫，強化戰術信號擴散與指令協同能力。", "Use to select and receive a Combat Style Module (Lv. 3). Receive 50 per use.": "自選獲得戰鬥風格模組（Lv3）。每次可獲得50個。", "100-Day Cumulative Login Reward.": "累積登入天數100天獎勵。", "Precisely adjusts healing intervals and status reinforcement parameters to improve coordinated support synchronization rates.": "精密調整治療間隔與狀態補強參數，提升聯動支援同步率。", "Open to randomly receive 1 Tactical-Grade Accessory. Tap to preview contents.": "開啟後可隨機獲得1件<color=#9BE1FE>戰術</color>等級飾品。點擊可預覽內容。", "Choose 1 piece of <color=#9BE1FE>Tactical</color> Physical-type Armor.": "指定選擇1件<color=#9BE1FE>戰術</color>級、物理類型的屬性防具。", "VIP 10 Exclusive Pack: Limited Portrait Frame.": "『VIP10專屬禮包』限定頭像框。", "[Title] At the end of darkness lies an even more brilliant dream.": "【稱號】黑暗的盡頭，是更加燦爛的夢想。", "War & Music Limited Profile Frame.": "『戰爭與音樂』限定頭像框。", "Integrates an advanced defense database to enhance combat command capability.": "整合高階防護資料庫，強化作戰指揮能力。", "Use to select and receive a Combat Style Module (Lv. 3). Receive 5 per use.": "自選獲得戰鬥風格模組（Lv3）。每次可獲得5個。", "Fuses a multi-domain defense architecture with a tactical master control core, designed specifically for Top Secret-tier combat units.": "融合全領域防禦架構與戰術主控核心，為最高機密等級作戰單位打造。", "Grants various Combat Style Modules (Lv. 2), Combat Training Records (Lv. 1), and Enhancement Components.": "可獲得各戰鬥風格模組（Lv2）、戰鬥訓練紀錄（Lv1），以及強化零件。", "Integrates comprehensive assault mechanisms and motion optimization solutions to support team combat.": "整合全方位突進機制與動作優化方案，支援團隊作戰。", "Obtained by performing the [Charlotte Targeted Summon]. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "進行【夏洛特指定召募】取得。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "Tobia's enchanting night. The city's vitality only awakens after nightfall, and with it, all its dangers are revealed.": "托比亞迷人的夜晚，城市的活力在夜幕低垂後才會甦醒，危險也都隨之顯露。", "Which goddesses had their scandalous photos leaked?": "是哪些女神的不雅照流出了？", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Rookie Maid - Sugimoto Arina</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR新手女僕-杉本 有菜</color>提升星等。", "Premium bird feed sourced from a professional aviary's organic garden. It'll fill her bird's belly and put a smile on Lin Lin's face. (Lin Lin's Affection +1000)": "來自專業鳥園附設有機菜園的高級鳥飼料。既能餵飽鈴鈴的鳥，也能讓她開心。（鈴鈴好感度+1000）", "Belonging only to you, making desire feel natural. (Alina's Affection +1000)": "只屬於你，讓慾望變得理所當然。（亞莉娜好感度+1000）", "Hard in texture, its surface features banded patterns of concentric circles or parallel layers. Obtainable from the [Black Gold Hunter] Warrant Stage. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "質地堅硬，表面具有同心圓或平行層疊的帶狀紋理。【黑金獵人】通緝令關卡取得。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "A fragment of a standard cluster crystal produced through quantum entanglement. Collecting a certain amount allows you to synthesize a standard cluster crystal.": "透過量子糾纏產生的普通叢狀晶體的碎片，集齊一定數量可以合成普通叢狀晶體。", "Randomly obtain 1 piece of Specialized Armor for a different Combat Style.": "隨機獲得1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級，不同戰鬥風格防具。", "A decryption key that unlocks a concluded event.": "解鎖已結束的活動的解碼金鑰。", "A contract issued to top-tier headhunters. Can be used for 10 Summons.": "委託專業人資獵才，可召募10次。", "A standard cluster crystal produced through quantum entanglement, which has undergone a high-pressure sealing treatment. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的普通叢狀晶體，但經過高壓密封處理，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "Fuses a wide-area support network with a target identification and distribution system, designed exclusively for top-secret logistics command units.": "融合廣域支援網路與目標識別分發，為最高機密等級後勤指導單位專屬打造。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SR Adele</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SR艾黛爾</color>提升星等。", "A powerful ruby Esper device created with advanced technology. It contains a large, flawless ruby and a control module, and can stably amplify Esper abilities several-fold. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過先進科技製造的強大的紅寶石異能裝置。內部有一個大型紅寶石與控制模組。能將異能穩定地增幅高達數倍，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "A high-density, high-quality rhombic crystal produced through quantum entanglement. It is synthesized under specific conditions and possesses a high energy density. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的高密度優質菱晶體，在特定條件下合成，具有高能量密度，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "Obtain a chosen Combat Style Module (Lv. 7) Grants 1 item each time.": "自選獲得戰鬥風格模組（Lv7）。每次可獲得1個。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Shiraishi Ai</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR白石 愛</color>提升星等。", "Choose 1 <color=#F7AFFD>Specialized</color> Accessory.": "指定選擇1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級飾品。", "A high-density, high-quality star crystal produced through quantum entanglement. It is synthesized under specific conditions and possesses a high energy density. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的高密度優質星晶體，在特定條件下合成，具有高能量密度，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "Summon one selected SR character. (Standard Summon Characters: Ruo Lan, Kurosawa Shion, Chloe, Charlotte, Milena, Amelie, Annabelle, Sugimoto Arina, Ogino Rui, Lin Lin, Liz, Li Mu)": "指定召募1名SSR角色。（一般召募角色：若蘭、黑澤 詩音、克蘿伊、夏洛特、米蓮娜、愛蜜莉、安娜貝爾、杉本 有菜、荻野 瑠衣、鈴鈴、莉茲、李沐）", "Randomly obtain 1 Specialized Breathable Armor.": "隨機獲得1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級透氣防具。", "Monthly Romantica, a fiction-focused literary journal cherished by young women, serves as a sanctuary for the dreams of countless girls. For Belle, it is also the outlet for her own sweet fantasies. (Belle's Affection +1000)": "「戀曲月刊」最受年輕女性歡迎的小說專門期刊，是許多少女心中的夢想棲息地同時也是貝兒甜美的幻想出口。（貝兒好感度+1000）", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Victoria</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR維多莉亞</color>提升星等。", "VIP 15 Exclusive Pack: Limited Portrait Frame.": "『VIP15專屬禮包』限定頭像框。", "Take a refreshing dip in that pool.": "暢遊那個泳池。", "Randomly obtain 1 Specialized Traceless Armor.": "隨機獲得1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級無痕防具。", "A professional journal that collects and reviews various bamboo flute scores. An excellent gift that caters to her tastes, perhaps it could even earn you the exclusive privilege of a private performance from this talented lady. (Qingyin's Affection +1000)": "蒐羅與評析各式竹笛樂譜的專業期刊。投其所好的絕佳禮物，也許能換來才女為你單獨吹奏的專屬福利。（清音好感度+1000）", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Amelie</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR愛蜜莉</color>提升星等。", "Use to summon the SSR character: Sugimoto Arina.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『杉本 有菜』。", "She has long since become someone far beyond my reach.": "「她現在早就成了我遙不可及的存在了呢。」", "Regardless of status or wealth, anyone who receives the mark becomes a fan. Obtained from Investigation Stages. Can be exchanged for items at the Exchange Shop.": "無論地位、貧窮或富貴，只要受了印就有了粉絲的身分。透過調查關卡取得，可於交易所兌換商品。", "Shady deals, power plays, and passionate desires are all part of daily life here.": "利益勾結、權謀計算、激情愛慾，是這裡每天都會發生的事。", "Default Profile Frame": "預設頭像框", "Power struggles and absurd sexual desires are concealed within this elegant Japanese-style room, never to be revealed.": "角力的權謀、荒誕的性慾，都被隱藏在這高雅的和室帶不出門。", "Contains the decryption key for a private exchange, granting priority access to high-risk, high-reward speculative intel. (Ruo Lan's Affection +1000)": "含有非公開交易所的價格解碼金鑰，能優先獲知具投機潛力但風險極高的消息。（若蘭好感度+1000）", "Use to randomly receive a Combat Style Module (Lv. 5). Receive 5 per use.": "隨機獲得戰鬥風格模組（Lv5）。每次可獲得5個。", "Suitable for beginners to learn basic fire support.": "適用於新手學習初級火力支援。", "The air is thick with the smell of dust and dirty, illicit dealings.": "空氣裡瀰漫的是灰塵與骯髒的不法勾當氣味。", "A standard star crystal produced through quantum entanglement, with average stability. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的普通星晶體，穩定性一般，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "What hits you is the scent of the sea breeze, mingled with the stench of fish and blood.": "迎面撞來的，是海風雜糅的魚腥和血腥。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Bernardo</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR貝爾納多</color>提升星等。", "This card certifies you as a Desperate Deathmatch participant. Use to restore Desperate Deathmatch challenge attempts.": "這張卡片證明你是絕命武鬥會的參賽者。使用後可補充絕命武鬥會挑戰次數。", "Late at night, the nurse continues tirelessly providing care to her patients.": "深夜時分，護理師仍勤勞不倦地為病患獻上服務。", "Ruby granules that have the property of slightly enhancing Esper abilities. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "紅寶石顆粒擁有小幅強化異能的特性。可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "Open to randomly receive an Enhancement Crystal. Click the icon to preview item contents.": "開啟後可隨機獲得強化晶體。點擊圖示可預覽道具內容。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Andou Kana</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR安藤 加奈</color>提升星等。", "Can be used in the Unlimited Summon to reroll until you get your desired result.": "可在無限召募中，重複召募直到滿意為止。", "Obtained from Fire Resonance stages. Can be exchanged for items at the Exchange Shop.": "透過火屬性共鳴關卡取得，可於交易所中兌換商品。", "Sapphire granules that have the property of slightly enhancing Esper abilities. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "藍寶石顆粒擁有小幅強化異能的特性。可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "Obtained by exchanging an SSR Medallion. Can be used to redeem a character at the SSR Advanced Agency.": "透過『SSR等級掛牌』兌換取得，可於交易所的『SSR精英介紹所』兌換角色。", "Elite combat training that combines battlefield experience with practical tactics. Can be used to quickly increase a character's EXP by {0}.": "頂級對抗演練，融合戰場經驗與實戰策略。能夠快速提升角色{0}經驗值。", "[Recreation Club] Visit the club 7 times within one week to receive a Lucky Wheel raffle ticket, with a chance to win a President Gold Card.": "【娛樂會館】一週內來館次數達到7次，即可獲得幸運滾輪抽獎券，有機率抽到會長金卡。", "A standard rhombic crystal produced through quantum entanglement, with average stability. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的普通菱晶體，穩定性一般，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "No matter how you struggle or scream, it is all in vain.": "無論怎麼掙扎、叫喚，都是徒勞。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Ojima Erina</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR小島 繪里奈</color>提升星等。", "With the passage of time and the weight of experience, Theodore will grow ever more formidable.": "隨著時間與事件的累積，西奧多將愈發強悍。", "Character Selector Ticket. Can be used for 1 Summon. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "指定角色召募卡，可召募1次。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "Open to randomly receive Gem Granules or Raw Ores. Click the icon to preview item contents.": "開啟後可隨機獲得寶石顆粒或原石。點擊圖示可預覽道具內容。", "Choose 1 <color=#F7AFFD>Specialized</color> Silver Ion Armor.": "指定選擇1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級銀離子防具。", "Business cards obtained from acquiring duplicate SSR characters at max stars. Can be exchanged for items at the Exchange Shop.": "SSR角色滿星後重複取得轉化的高級名片，可於交易所兌換商品。", "Choose one piece of <color=#F7AFFD>Specialized</color> Energy-Type Armor.": "指定選擇1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級、能量類型的屬性防具。", "Use to randomly receive a Combat Style Module (Lv. 2). Receive 5 per use.": "隨機獲得戰鬥風格模組（Lv2）。每次可獲得5個。", "Bringing music, emotions, and people together, creating an immersive experience of soulful resonance.": "將音樂、情感與人凝聚在一起，沉浸在心靈的共振之中。", "A perfect star crystal produced through quantum entanglement. It is crafted with the highest-spec techniques, resulting in minimal parameter variation. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的完美星晶體，以最高規格工藝製成，參數變異極小，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "Immediately restores 50 Stamina.": "立即恢復50點體力。", "In broad daylight, you can have pleasure anywhere.": "光天化日之下，隨處都可以舒服。", "Use to summon the SSR character: Chloe.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『克蘿伊』。", "Use to summon the SSR character: Milena.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『米蓮娜』。", "Choose 1 <color=#F7AFFD>Specialized</color> Low-Maintenance Armor.": "指定選擇1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級免洗耐用防具。", "Obtained by performing the [Sugimoto Arina Targeted Summon]. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "進行【杉本 有菜指定召募】取得。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "Obtained from Water Resonance stages. Can be exchanged for items at the Exchange Shop.": "透過水屬性共鳴關卡取得，可於交易所中兌換商品。", "50-Day Cumulative Login Reward.": "累積登入天數50天獎勵。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up<color=#e88418>SSR Fujiwara Arisa</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR藤原 亞璃紗</color>提升星等。", "Use to summon the SSR character: Jessica.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『潔西卡』。", "As the sun sinks low, the gradually lit city calls out to pedestrians and perils alike.": "太陽低垂之後，逐漸點亮的城市，呼喚行人與危機。", "Ore required to rank up equipment, obtained from <color=#e88418>Practical Assessment</color> stages.": "提升裝備星等所需的礦石，從<color=#e88418>實戰檢核</color>取得。", "Gold Bars symbolize eternal wealth and can be exchanged for any power or resource you desire.": "金條象徵永恆財富，能兌換所有你渴望的力量與資源。", "A premium spa voucher for two, specially prepared for you and your inseparable partner. Cherish every moment of belonging and elegance with precious time spent together. (Amber's Affection +1000)": "精選雙人高級SPA招待卷，為親密無間的你們準備，用珍貴的陪伴共度每一刻的歸屬感與優雅。 安柏好感度+1000）", "Use to summon the SR character: Belle.": "使用後可召募SR角色：『貝兒』。", "Filthy and dark, the stench of crime permeates this place. Unfamiliar faces will be met with suspicion; you'll need some connections or know-how to find any illicit dealings.": "骯髒又黑暗，犯罪的惡臭瀰漫於此，陌生的臉孔會被警戒，要有點門路、關係才能找到不法的勾當。", "Choose one piece of <color=#F7AFFD>Specialized</color> SSR Character Exclusive Footwear. (Standard Summon Characters: Ruo Lan, Kurosawa Shion, Chloe, Charlotte, Milena, Amelie, Annabelle, Sugimoto Arina, Ogino Rui, Lin Lin, Liz, Li Mu)": "指定選擇1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級SSR角色專屬足部。（一般召募角色：若蘭、黑澤 詩音、克蘿伊、夏洛特、米蓮娜、愛蜜莉、安娜貝爾、杉本 有菜、荻野 瑠衣、鈴鈴、莉茲、李沐）", "Use to summon the SSR character: Lin Lin.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『鈴鈴』。", "Increases the number of [Combat Expertise] attempts by 1.": "可增加1次【戰技專精】次數。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Danxin</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR丹芯</color>提升星等。", "Use to randomly receive a Combat Style Module (Lv. 6). Receive 5 per use.": "隨機獲得戰鬥風格模組（Lv6）。每次可獲得5個。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Hijikata Chizuru</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR土方 千鶴</color>提升星等。", "Compact and easy to carry, available in a variety of natural scents. Perfect for meditation and relaxation. It comes with a delicate lid or carrying pouch. (Theodore's Affection +1000)": "小巧便於攜帶，推出了許多不同自然香調，適合冥想、放空。帶有精緻蓋子或收納袋。（西奧多好感度+1000）", "Business cards obtained from acquiring duplicate SR characters at max stars. Can be exchanged for items at the Exchange Shop.": "SR角色滿星後重複取得轉化的名片，可於交易所兌換商品。", "Hahaha! I'm gonna tear you all to shreads!!": "「哈哈哈，我要把你們一個個都撕成碎片——！！」", "Open to randomly receive a Basic Crystal. Click the icon to preview item contents.": "開啟後可隨機獲得初級晶體。點擊圖示可預覽道具內容。", "The level of support shown for your favorite idol, used as the basis for fan ranking in the Heaven's Door event. Obtained by exchanging for merchandise in Heaven's Door. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "對喜歡的偶像應援的程度，為天堂之門活動排行粉絲地位的依據，於天堂之門交換周邊商品獲得。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "A set of kitchen knives recommended by a famous chef. Beautiful and sharp, this gift is perfect for Arisa, who loves to cook. (Fujiwara Arisa's Affection +1000)": "知名主廚推薦使用的廚房刀具，美觀又鋒利，熱愛烹飪的亞璃紗會喜歡這份禮物。（藤原 亞璃紗好感度+1000）", "A pass containing a digital authorization certificate. Once activated, it can be used to complete designated procedures directly, making it the best choice for mission efficiency and task management.": "內建數位授權的憑證通行票。啟用後可直接完成指定流程，為行動效率與任務管理的最佳選擇。", "Use to summon the SR character: Adele.": "使用後可召募SR角色：『艾黛爾』。", "Use to summon the SSR character: Elena.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『伊蓮娜』。", "A medal obtained from the Carducci Arena. Can be exchanged for items at the Exchange Shop.": "在卡迪久擂台取得的勳章，可於交易所兌換商品。", "Use to randomly receive a Combat Style Module (Lv. 3). Receive 5 per use.": "隨機獲得戰鬥風格模組（Lv3）。每次可獲得5個。", "Is a physical examination necessary?": "必須要檢查身體嗎？", "Use to summon the SSR character: Connie.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『昆妮』。", "Utilizing advanced technology, multiple sapphire chips are integrated into a single module device that enhances performance when synchronized with other modules. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過先進科技將多個藍寶石晶片整合為模組裝置，與其他模組同步運作增強效能。可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "As the room sinks into darkness, the mind grows bright.": "房間沉在黑暗之中，心思也就明亮了起來。", "Use to summon the SSR character: Andou Kana.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『安藤 加奈』。", "Choose 1 <color=#F7AFFD>Specialized</color> Breathable Armor.": "指定選擇1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級透氣防具。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Kurosawa Shion</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR黑澤 詩音</color>提升星等。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Charlotte</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR夏洛特</color>提升星等。", "Randomly obtain 1 Specialized Retroreflective Armor.": "隨機獲得1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級逆反射防具。", "Use to summon the SSR character: Liz.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『莉茲』。", "[Title] A loving after-school tutoring session can always reform even the most stubborn delinquents.": "【稱號】愛的課後輔導，總能教化那些頑劣分子。", "Carducci Arena Weekly Rank 1 Reward": "『卡迪久擂台』週排名No.1獎勵。", "The price for refusing to cooperate with the investigation is a grueling interrogation that will wring you dry.": "不願配合偵辦，代價就是被搾乾的激烈審訊。", "Use to select and receive an Elemental Forged Steel. Receive 1 per use.": "自選獲得屬性鍛鋼。每次可獲得1個。", "A ray of light in hell.": "地獄中的一線光明。", "A high-density, high-quality triangular crystal produced through quantum entanglement. It is synthesized under specific conditions and possesses a high energy density. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的高密度優質三角晶體，在特定條件下合成，具有高能量密度，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "Randomly obtain 1 Specialized Water-Resistant Armor.": "隨機獲得1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級抗水防具。", "Use to select and receive a Combat Style Module (Lv. 1). Receive 50 per use.": "自選獲得戰鬥風格模組（Lv1）。每次可獲得50個。", "Who's this pretty boy lying here anyway?": "「這個躺在這裡的小白臉到底是誰啊？」", "Use to summon the SSR character: Annabelle.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『安娜貝爾』。", "A perfect spherical crystal produced through quantum entanglement. It is crafted with the highest-spec techniques, resulting in minimal parameter variation. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的完美球狀晶體，以最高規格工藝製成，參數變異極小，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "Choose 1 <color=#F7AFFD>Specialized</color> Photochromic Armor.": "指定選擇1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級光變色防具。", "The light shines in the darkness, and the darkness has not overcome it.": "光照在黑暗裡，黑暗卻不接受光。", "A nightmare from the abyss, tightly coiling and burrowing deep into mind and flesh.": "來自深淵的噩夢，緊緊纏繞著，深入心靈與肉體。", "The weather in Tobia is even more fickle than a young girl's heart.": "托比亞的天氣，比起女孩子來說更加陰晴不定。", "Choose 1 <color=#F7AFFD>Specialized</color> Impermeable Armor.": "指定選擇1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級不透水防具。", "Use to summon the SSR character: Komachi Yuu.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『小町 憂』。", "Obtained by performing the [Ruo Lan Targeted Summon]. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "進行【若蘭指定召募】取得。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "Randomly summon 1 SR character. (Standard Summon Characters: Aira, Denice, Vera, Mudia, Yulia, Lin Lan, Takajou Ranka, Katya, Thalia)": "隨機召募1名SR角色。（一般召募角色：艾拉、丹妮絲、維菈、穆蒂雅、尤莉亞、凌嵐、高城 嵐花、卡緹亞、塔莉亞）", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Awana</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR沫沫</color>提升星等。", "Fuses an all-domain computing core, designed for top-secret combat units.": "融合全領域運算核心，為最高等級作戰打造。", "...": "#0000000000000000000013051_…………", "Utilizing advanced technology, an emerald is controlled by a microchip to achieve a stable amplification effect. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過先進科技將綠寶石以微晶片控制，達到穩定增幅的效果。可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "At the most romantic candlelit dinner, indulge in the ultimate raw desire and passion.": "在最浪漫的燭光晚餐，享受最頂級的肉體和激情。", "Use to summon the SSR character: Ruo Lan.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『若蘭』。", "A popular stress-relief spray blending lavender and eucalyptus with a soothing base inspired by aromatherapy massage formulas. Sugimoto Arina, whose ample bust makes her prone to shoulder and neck stiffness, sprays a few times before bed to relax and enjoy a good night's sleep. (Rookie Maid - Sugimoto Arina's Affection +1000)": "極受好評的舒壓噴霧，薰衣草混著尤加利的清香，並帶有仿芳療按摩配方的舒緩基底。胸圍傲人的有菜，肩頸因而特別容易僵，她總會睡前先噴幾下讓肩膀放鬆，換來一夜好眠。（新手女僕-杉本 有菜好感度+1000）", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SR Theodore</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SR西奧多</color>提升星等。", "A chest containing various types of Forged Steel. Obtain 5 per use.": "內含各式鍛鋼的箱子。每次可獲得5個。", "A fragment of a standard spherical crystal produced through quantum entanglement. Collecting a certain amount allows you to synthesize a standard spherical crystal.": "透過量子糾纏產生的普通球狀晶體的碎片，集齊一定數量可以合成普通球狀晶體。", "Ultimate Whale.": "火山孝子。", "Obtained by performing the [Li Mu Targeted Summon]. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "進行【李沐指定召募】取得。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "Obtained by performing the [Milena Targeted Summon]. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "進行【米蓮娜指定召募】取得。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "Use to summon the SSR character: Danxin.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『丹芯』。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Rachel</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR瑞秋</color>提升星等。", "It really is... so breathtakingly beautiful.": "「真的是……十分美麗呢。」", "Obtained by performing the [Annabelle Targeted Summon]. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "進行【安娜貝爾指定召募】取得。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "An education in love, built upon unforgettable lessons that leave a lasting impression. Obtained from Investigation Stages. Can be exchanged for items at the Exchange Shop.": "愛的教育，建立的銘刻入骨的鞭策上。透過調查關卡取得，可於交易所兌換商品。", "Fewer people go to the opera these days, and to some young people, it might even seem old-fashioned. But this form of artistic expression is still beloved by many. (Elena's Affection +1000)": "會看歌劇的人已經變少了，對於部分年輕人而言甚至有些老套。但這種藝術呈現的方式，仍受許多人的喜愛。（伊蓮娜好感度+1000）", "Use to randomly receive a Combat Style Module (Lv. 1). Receive 5 per use.": "隨機獲得戰鬥風格模組（Lv1）。每次可獲得5個。", "A double bed. How many times has it been tumbled upon? How many lingering traces of unbridled desires does it hold?": "一張雙人床，翻滾過多少次數，遺留了多少難忘的激情？", "A standard cubic crystal produced through quantum entanglement, with average stability. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的普通方晶體，穩定性一般，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "A fragment of a standard triangular crystal produced through quantum entanglement. Collecting a certain amount allows you to synthesize a standard triangular crystal.": "透過量子糾纏產生的普通三角晶體的碎片，集齊一定數量可以合成普通三角晶體。", "Obtained from events. Can be exchanged for premium items at the Exchange Shop.": "透過活動取得，可於交易所兌換高價商品。", "Obtained by completing missions. Accumulate them to claim rewards.": "完成任務獲得，累積可領取獎勵。", "Open to randomly receive Gem Granules, Raw Ores, or Cores. Click the icon to preview item contents.": "開啟後可隨機獲得寶石顆粒、原石或核心。點擊圖示可預覽道具內容。", "A mini massage oil gift set with an elegant design, featuring four natural fragrances. Receiving this gift will let her know you care. (Sugimoto Arina's Affection +1000)": "設計高雅、搭配四種天然香氛的迷你按摩油禮盒，收到這份禮物，讓她體會到你的關懷。（杉本 有菜好感度+1000）", "[Standard Summon] Use to randomly Summon one SSR character from the Advanced Summon.": "【一般召募】使用後可隨機召募一名精英召募中的SSR角色。", "A standard triangular crystal produced through quantum entanglement, with average stability. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的普通三角晶體，穩定性一般，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "Brilliant festival banners hang high for the Yoikasumi Festival. This is a dreamlike annual event in the Moonflower pleasure district.": "高掛起宵霞祭的彩幔，這是月華花街一年一度的幻夢盛事。", "Limited Armament Resupply Ticket. Can be used for 10 Resupplies. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "限定武裝補給卡，可補給10次。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "Choose 1 piece of <color=#9BE1FE>Tactical</color> Energy-type Armor.": "指定選擇1件<color=#9BE1FE>戰術</color>級、能量類型的屬性防具。", "A high-quality triangular crystal produced through quantum entanglement, featuring high purity and a smooth crystal surface. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的優質三角晶體，純度高、晶體表面平滑，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "Precisely adjusts reaction and defense capabilities to improve combat synchronization rates.": "精密調整反應與防禦能力，提升作戰同步率。", "Rank 100 Reward.": "Rank100獎勵。", "A stage in heat is the most alluring of all.": "發情的舞台才是最迷人的。", "Use to summon the SSR character: Charlotte.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『夏洛特』。", "Enhances propulsion stability and close-quarters dash efficiency. Contains an intermediate-level kinetic module.": "強化推進穩定性與近戰衝刺效率，內含中級動能模組。", "A small quantity of high-quality cubic crystals produced through quantum entanglement. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的少量高優質方晶體，在精煉過程中進行多次檢測與修正，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Jessica</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR潔西卡</color>提升星等。", "Use to choose an Epic Bonded Accessory.": "使用後可選擇一件史詩品質的專屬飾品。", "Choose 1 <color=#F7AFFD>Specialized</color> Fire-Retardant Armor.": "指定選擇1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級防火防具。", "A small quantity of high-quality star crystals produced through quantum entanglement. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的少量高優質星晶體，在精煉過程中進行多次檢測與修正，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "Randomly obtain 1 Specialized Fire-Retardant Armor.": "隨機獲得1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級防火防具。", "Created by a retired Tobian soldier, this high-potency coffee blend is infused with a specially formulated Esper neural activation compound that significantly boosts mental focus and reaction speed. (Rachel's Affection +1000)": "托比亞退役軍人創立，所推出的高濃度咖啡飲品加入了特別調製的異能神經活化配方，能大幅提升思維專注與反應速度。（瑞秋好感度+1000）", "Open to choose a Peculiar Special Gem, Tap the icon to preview the item's contents.": "開啟後可自行選擇一顆奇異的特殊寶石，點擊圖示可預覽道具內容。", "Obtained through Packs and the [Echoing Melody] Armament Resupply Chest. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "透過禮包與【音行自鳴】武裝補給箱取得。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "A sapphire core that has been cut and polished, possessing the property of amplifying Esper powers. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "經過切割與拋光處理的藍寶石核心擁有增幅異能的特性。可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "The hot water pours down, washing away exhaustion and settling the mind.": "熱水澆淋，沖走疲勞，沉澱思緒。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Komachi Yuu</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR小町 憂</color>提升星等。", "Use to select and receive a Combat Style Module (Lv. 5). Receive 5 per use.": "自選獲得戰鬥風格模組（Lv5）。每次可獲得5個。", "Choose 1 <color=#F7AFFD>Specialized</color> Water-Resistant Armor.": "指定選擇1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級抗水防具。", "You're just a cum dumpster for me to use and abuse.": "不過是發洩的肉便器而已。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Amber</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR安柏</color>提升星等。", "A emerald core that has been cut and polished, possessing the property of amplifying Esper powers. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "經過切割與拋光處理的綠寶石核心擁有增幅異能的特性。可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "If you're not going to obey, then this cock will have to teach you a lesson.": "不順從的話，就必須用肉棒教訓一下才行。", "Use to summon the SSR character: Banxia.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『半夏』。", "Raw emeralds are natural, unprocessed products with powerful potential. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "綠寶石原石是未經加工的自然產物，擁有強大的潛能。可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "[Recreation Club] With this ticket, enjoy exclusive access to the venue after hours.": "【娛樂會館】持有此張票券可暢遊非營業時段的場館。", "Specialized invisible lingerie featuring a skin-conforming gel interior. Engineered for an instant cup-size boost, it sculpts a natural silhouette with a seamless, wire-free design. (Charlotte's Affection +1000)": "特製隱形內衣，內層為皮膚貼合凝膠材質，具有瞬間罩杯升級效果，可在無鋼圈條件下撐起自然曲線。（夏洛特好感度+1000）", "Use to randomly summon one SSR character: Komachi Sayaka or Hijikata Chizuru.": "使用後可隨機召募一名SSR角色：『小町 咲香』或『土方 千鶴』。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SR Belle</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SR貝兒</color>提升星等。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Ruby</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR露比</color>提升星等。", "The grand hall of paradise. Everyone in the world would give up everything just to enter this place, from girls chasing star-studded dreams, to men hunting for sultry beauties.": "天堂的大廳，世上所有人都願拋下一切只為進入這裡，無論追求星夢的女孩，或是追求窈窕淑女的男人們。", "Choose 1 <color=#F7AFFD>Specialized</color> Heat-Resistant Armor.": "指定選擇1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級耐熱防具。", "A fine sake from the far East, featuring a bottle adorned with Ukiyo-e style nightscapes. For those seeking the ultimate state of relaxation, this is truly the pinnacle of refinement. (Hijikata Chizuru's Affection +1000)": "來自遙遠東方的清酒，瓶身繪有浮世繪風格的夜景，對於追求極致放鬆的人來說，無疑是絕佳聖品。（土方 千鶴好感度+1000）", "A ruby core that has been cut and polished, possessing the property of amplifying Esper powers. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "經過切割與拋光處理的紅寶石核心擁有增幅異能的特性。可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "Precisely adjusts motion response and combat accuracy to improve combat chain synchronization.": "精密調整動作反應與格鬥命中率，提升作戰連鎖流程同步。", "Now, I shall don this attire, and let my dance speak for itself.": "「如今，咲香將著上此衣，並以舞姿代為傳達其意。」", "The potion's side effects caused reason to be overwhelmed by desire.": "藥劑的副作用，讓理性被慾望給淹沒。", "The loneliness of tragedy is the most timeless love. Obtainable from the event; can be used to exchange for items at the Exchange Shop. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "悲劇的孤獨，是最雋永的愛情。透過活動取得，可於交易所兌換商品。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "Open to randomly receive 1 Common-Grade accessory. Tap to preview contents.": "開啟後可隨機獲得1件普通等級飾品。點擊可預覽內容。", "Looks like the lab-grown replacement heart turned out to be useless again.": "「看來這次培養的代用心臟也沒什麼用呢。」", "Obtained by performing the [Amelie Targeted Summon]. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "進行【愛蜜莉指定召募】取得。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "Must smell wonderful.": "一定很香。", "Supports versatile fire support missions, suitable for high-density combat zones.": "支援複合型態火力任務，適用於高密度戰區。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Banxia</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR半夏</color>提升星等。", "Use to randomly summon one SSR character: Qingyin or Leng Zhen.": "使用後可隨機召募一名SSR角色：『清音』或『冷鴆』。", "[Title] The flute's melody pierces through endless mist; in a blink, one stands before the Azure Dragon.": "【稱號】橫笛吹開千層霧，此身已在青龍處。", "Grants various Combat Style Modules (Lv. 1), Combat Training Records (Lv. 1), and Enhancement Components.": "可獲得各戰鬥風格模組（Lv1）、戰鬥訓練紀錄（Lv1），以及強化零件。", "Use to summon the SSR character: Qingyin": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『清音』。", "Contains parts used for equipment reinforcement, including fabrics, buckles, padding, carbon fiber cloth, and ceramic armor plates.": "包含布料、扣具、緩衝墊、碳纖維布、防彈陶瓷片等強化裝備使用的零件。", "A company in the top 1%, a dream job lusted after by all. Yet behind this glittering facade lies a dream tangled in the darkest sins.": "PR 99的公司，所有人都嚮往的工作。金玉其外的夢，裡頭卻纏滿罪惡的黑暗。", "Use to summon the SSR character: Ariana.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『亞莉娜』。", "Advanced combat training that enhances your combat skills. Can be used to quickly increase a character's EXP by {0}.": "高階戰鬥教學，強化你的實戰能力。能夠快速提升角色{0}經驗值。", "Suitable for beginner sniper practice. Activates the basic aim-assist function.": "適用於新手狙擊練習，啟動初級瞄準輔助功能。", "One of the mysterious records of the Elemental Altar. Can be used to unlock the pictures in the Sakura Codex.": "元素祭壇的神祕記載之一，可用於解鎖櫻部圖鑑中的圖片。", "A piece with a bold, unmistakable logo and avant-garde design that prioritizes style over function. Amelie will approve of your taste if you give this to her. (Amelie's Affection +1000)": "品牌標誌顯眼，設計誇張，比起實用更注重能不能被看到。她會因此認可你的眼光。（愛蜜莉好感度+1000）", "Choose one piece of <color=#F7AFFD>Specialized</color> Physical-Type Armor.": "指定選擇1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級、物理類型的屬性防具。", "Obtained from Light Resonance stages. Can be exchanged for items at the Exchange Shop.": "透過光屬性共鳴關卡取得，可於交易所中兌換商品。", "...Thank you...": "「……謝謝你……」", "The gateway to Tobia. A destination coveted by many people. After all, a good environment is the most important thing for a bright future.": "托比亞的門戶，世界上所有的人都想進入這裡，一個美好的未來最重要的就是良好環境。", "Precisely adjusts critical hit parameters and area control to improve strike efficiency.": "精密調整爆擊參數與範圍控制，提升打擊效率。", "Randomly summon 1 SSR character. (Standard Summon Characters: Ruo Lan, Kurosawa Shion, Chloe, Charlotte, Milena, Amelie, Annabelle, Sugimoto Arina, Ogino Rui, Lin Lin, Liz, Li Mu)": "隨機召募1名SSR角色。（一般召募角色：若蘭、黑澤 詩音、克蘿伊、夏洛特、米蓮娜、愛蜜莉、安娜貝爾、杉本 有菜、荻野 瑠衣、鈴鈴、莉茲、李沐）", "Limited Character Summon Ticket. Can be used for 10 Summons. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "限定角色召募卡，可召募10次。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "All traces of Adele's life are laid bare before you.": "艾黛爾生活的痕跡，在你面前嶄露無遺。", "[Title] The Moonflower fireworks illuminate a place for the drifters to call their own.": "【稱號】月華煙花，照亮漂流者的容身之處。", "Integrates a heavy armament deployment system to support multiple combat units.": "整合重武裝調度系統，支援多個作戰單位。", "One of the laboratory's materials. It can stabilize experimental conditions to prevent life-threatening explosions.": "實驗室的材料之一。能穩定實驗狀況，不至於爆炸造成生命危險。", "Step into the solemn main house of the Moonflower Clan, where every blade of grass and every tree exudes order, etiquette, and chivalry.": "步入莊嚴的月華組本家，一草一木都能感受到秩序、禮儀與俠義。", "Use to randomly receive an Elemental Cluster. Receive 1 per use.": "隨機獲得屬性晶簇。每次可獲得1個。", "She thoroughly enjoyed being conquered by such a powerful man, relishing the brutal, primal nature of his treatment.": "她很享受被這樣強大的男人征服，以及這種獸性的粗暴對待。", "30-Day Cumulative Login Reward.": "累積登入天數30天獎勵。", "Obtained by performing the [Ogino Rui Targeted Summon]. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "進行【荻野 瑠衣指定召募】取得。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "Use to summon the SR character: Denice.": "使用後可召募SR角色：『丹妮絲』。", "Enhances stability and target-locking capabilities. Contains an intermediate-level sensor component.": "強化穩定性與目標鎖定能力，內含中級感測元件。", "Only a ruler with the power to command all is worthy of this study.": "只有能夠統御一切的權力者，才配得上這間書房。", "Obtained by performing the [Advanced Summon].": "進行【精英召募】取得。", "Obtained by performing the [1M Downloads Celebration Summon]. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "進行【100萬下載紀念期間召募】取得。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "An aroma that can stir sexual desire often lingers within.": "裡面時常縈繞著可以刺激性慾的芳香。", "Personalized combat wraps featuring integrated sensor filaments. It can instantly harden its surface when an Esper ability is activated, boosting destructive power while protecting the user's hands and showing off their personal style. (Bernardo's Affection +1000)": "個性化設計的拳擊膠帶，材料中融入感應導線，可在異能發動時瞬間固化表面，提升破壞力同時也保護拳部，同時也彰顯個人風格。（貝爾納多好感度+1000）", "Obtained from Dark Resonance stages. Can be exchanged for items at the Exchange Shop.": "透過闇屬性共鳴關卡取得，可於交易所中兌換商品。", "A premium voucher for top-tier salon services, including styling, hair and nail services and private make up consultations. (Affection +250)": "一份高級體驗券，可在頂尖沙龍預約使用，包括造型設計、美髮美甲以及私人彩妝諮詢等服務。（好感度+250）", "Integrates an advanced ballistic and explosive databases to enhance destructive power against high-value targets.": "整合高階彈道與爆破資料庫，強化對高價值目標的破壞力。", "Use to summon the SSR character: Ojima Erina.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『小島 繪里奈』。", "Keep tapping along to the rhythm! This is a luxurious experience reserved for our most distinguished guests.": "跟著節奏拍打吧！這是貴客才能享受的奢華體驗。", "Supports versatile assistance and enhancement missions in hybrid warfare environments.": "支援複合型態作戰環境下的多角色支援與強化任務。", "...Theodore?": "「……西奧多？」", "This will end in two minutes.": "「兩分鐘解決。」", "A reward obtained from the Desperate Deathmatch. Can be exchanged for items at the Exchange Shop.": "在絕命武鬥會取得的獎勵，可於交易所兌換商品", "Use to summon the SSR character: Leng Zhen": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『冷鴆』。", "Use to summon the SSR character: Ruby.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『露比』。", "The things discussed here are beyond what an ordinary person could ever imagine.": "在這裡談論的都是超乎一般人想像的事。", "A limited-edition mini lipstick set by a fashion brand, featuring three beautifully designed, trendy shades. These cute lipsticks make for a delightful and charming little gift. (Affection +50)": "由時尚品牌推出的限量迷你口紅組，內含3支有精美設計、流行色號的小巧口紅，足以引發歡心與共鳴的小禮物。（好感度+50）", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Lin Lin</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR鈴鈴</color>提升星等。", "Randomly obtain a Combat Style Module (Lv. 7). Grants 1 item each time.": "隨機獲得戰鬥風格模組（Lv7）。每次可獲得1個。", "Integrates a full-field connection module and a status-aware system to support early-warning tactics.": "整合全場域連結模組與狀態感知系統，支援預警戰術。", "Romantic Valentine Limited Profile Frame.": "『浪漫情人節』限定頭像框。", "An organic fossil formed from ancient resin with a smooth, gentle feel. Obtainable in the [Black Gold Hunter] Warrant Stage. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "由遠古樹脂演化而成的有機生物化石，觸感溫潤。【黑金獵人】通緝令關卡取得。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "A high-quality rhombic crystal produced through quantum entanglement, featuring high purity and a smooth crystal surface.": "透過量子糾纏產生的優質菱晶體，純度高、晶體表面平滑，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "Witness the birth of a new generation of female idols. Countless people have been captivated in this place, losing their hearts and their fortunes.": "見證新世代女偶像的誕生，在這裡被迷得神魂顛倒、傾家蕩產的人比比皆是。", "The vitality needed to interact with women.": "與女性互動需要的活力。", "Business cards obtained from acquiring duplicate R characters at max stars. Can be exchanged for items at the Exchange Shop.": "R角色滿星後重複取得轉化的名片，可於交易所兌換商品。", "Precisely adjusts aiming accuracy and firing rhythm to improve long-range combat efficiency and fluency.": "精密調整瞄準精度與擊發節奏，提升遠距作戰效率與流暢度。", "An extra-large cup of bubble tea filled with chewy pearls. An indispensable sweet drink for daily life. Chewing on pearls while mulling over intel is the most relaxing time of all. (Banxia's Affection +1000)": "裝滿Q彈珍珠的特大杯奶茶。日常不可或缺的甜飲。一邊咀嚼珍珠一邊盤算情報，是最放鬆的時刻。（半夏好感度+1000）", "Tell me why you did it?! Brother!": "「告訴我為什麼這麼做！？大哥！」", "A powerful sapphire Esper device created with advanced technology. It contains a large, flawless sapphire and a control module, and can stably amplify Esper abilities several-fold. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過先進科技製造的強大的藍寶石異能裝置。內部有多個完美藍寶石與控制模組。能將異能穩定地增幅高達數倍，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "Use to summon the SR character: Katya.": "使用後可召募SR角色：『卡緹亞』。", "A comfortable, energetic, and positive space.": "舒適、充滿活力、積極向上的空間。", "Choose one piece of <color=#F7AFFD>Specialized</color> SSR Character Exclusive Weapon. (Standard Summon Characters: Ruo Lan, Kurosawa Shion, Chloe, Charlotte, Milena, Amelie, Annabelle, Sugimoto Arina, Ogino Rui, Lin Lin, Liz, Li Mu)": "指定選擇1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級SSR角色專屬武器。（一般召募角色：若蘭、黑澤 詩音、克蘿伊、夏洛特、米蓮娜、愛蜜莉、安娜貝爾、杉本 有菜、荻野 瑠衣、鈴鈴、莉茲、李沐）", "A standard cluster crystal produced through quantum entanglement, with average stability. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的普通叢狀晶體，穩定性一般，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "Choose 1 <color=#F7AFFD>Specialized</color> Traceless Armor.": "指定選擇1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級無痕防具。", "So long, loser.": "「永別了，廢物。」", "Obtained by exchanging a SR Medallion. Can be used to redeem a character at the Rookie Agency.": "透過『SR等級掛牌』兌換取得，可於『新銳仲介所』兌換角色。", "A quartz crystal with high Mohs hardness and a pure, transparent texture. Obtainable in the [Black Gold Hunter] Warrant Stage. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "莫氏硬度高，屬石英結晶體，呈現純淨透明的質地。【黑金獵人】通緝令關卡取得。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "Made with seasonal fruits and a unique secret Blueprint, the first sip has a refreshingly cool sensation, followed by a warm, spicy finish. Perfect for a small drink after work. (Liz's Affection +1000)": "選用當季水果搭配獨有的秘製配方，入口帶有微微清涼，尾韻卻有溫暖辣意，適合在下班後小酌一杯。（莉茲好感度+1000）", "Life is like this book of recipes, you never know what you're going to get.": "人生就像這本配方書，你永遠不知道你會拿到什麼。", "Since you have come so far and honor me with your presence, it is only right that I entertain you.": "「遠道而來，既肯賞光，自當奉陪。」", "Rank 70 Reward.": "Rank70獎勵。", "A fragment of a standard star crystal produced through quantum entanglement. Collecting a certain amount allows you to synthesize a standard star crystal.": "透過量子糾纏產生的普通星晶體的碎片，集齊一定數量可以合成普通星晶體。", "Randomly obtain 1 Specialized Impermeable Armor.": "隨機獲得1件<color=#F7AFFD>特化</color>級不透水防具。", "A fragment of a standard cubic crystal produced through quantum entanglement. Collecting a certain amount allows you to synthesize a standard cubic crystal.": "透過量子糾纏產生的普通方晶體的碎片，集齊一定數量可以合成普通方晶體。", "Use to summon the SR character: Theodore.": "使用後可召募SR角色：『西奧多』。", "Features a finely interwoven fibrous structure, giving it a green hue that ranges from translucent to opaque. Obtainable in the [Black Gold Hunter] Warrant Stage. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "具細密纖維交織結構，呈現半透明到不透明的綠。【黑金獵人】通緝令關卡取得。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)", "Use to summon the SSR character: Rachel.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『瑞秋』。", "Use to summon the SSR character: Komachi Sayaka.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『小町 咲香』。", "Use to randomly receive a Combat Style Module (Lv. 4). Receive 5 per use.": "隨機獲得戰鬥風格模組（Lv4）。每次可獲得5個。", "A standard spherical crystal produced through quantum entanglement, with average stability. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的普通球狀晶體，穩定性一般，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "VIP Experience. Accumulate experience to raise your reputation in Tobia.": "VIP經驗值。累積經驗可提升在托比亞受尊敬的程度。", "Use to summon the SR character: Aira.": "使用後可召募SR角色：『艾拉』。", "Rank 30 Reward.": "Rank30獎勵。", "A promotion certificate issued by senior authorities, awarded only to members who have demonstrated outstanding performance. It serves as official verification that the holder is authorized to advance to a higher rank. Can be used to rank up <color=#e88418>SSR Li Mu</color>.": "一張由高階核發的晉升證書，僅授予達成卓越表現的成員，證明持有者具備晉升至更高階級的資格與權限。可以讓<color=#e88418>SSR李沐</color>提升星等。", "A premium service you can only enjoy after letting yourself be played for a sucker.": "必須先成為肥羊，才能有機會享受到的頂級服務。", "One could happily spend a whole day here, just waiting for a sudden surprise.": "會喜歡在這裡待上一天，期待突然而至的驚喜。", "A high-quality cluster crystal produced through quantum entanglement, featuring high purity and a smooth crystal surface. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的優質叢狀晶體，純度高、晶體表面平滑，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "Immediately restores 50 Stamina. Valid for 7 days only.": "立即恢復50點體力，有效期限僅有7日。", "Collect {0} to combine into {1}.": "集齊{0}個可以組合成{1}。", "Use to select and receive a Combat Style Module (Lv. 6). Receive 50 per use.": "自選獲得戰鬥風格模組（Lv6）。每次可獲得50個。", "Use to summon the SR character: Vera.": "使用後可召募SR角色：『維菈』。", "A perfect triangular crystal produced through quantum entanglement. It is crafted with the highest-spec techniques, resulting in minimal parameter variation. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的完美三角晶體，以最高規格工藝製成，參數變異極小，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "70-Day Cumulative Login Reward.": "累積登入天數70天獎勵。", "Use to summon the SSR character: Fujiwara Shiyoi.": "使用後可召募SSR角色：『藤原 紫宵』。", "Use to restore challenge attempts for the Carducci Arena.": "使用後可補充卡迪久擂台挑戰次數。", "A standard rhombic crystal produced through quantum entanglement, which has undergone a high-pressure sealing treatment. Can be installed in an Esper amplification device.": "透過量子糾纏產生的普通菱晶體，但經過高壓密封處理，可安裝至異能增幅裝置中。", "This Blueprint is a high-investment, high-risk endeavor, but the rewards are just as great.": "這本配方書高投資高風險，相對的也高報酬。", "Obtained by performing the [Clumsy Cowgirl - Belle Limited Summon]. (This item will be reclaimed after the current event ends.)": "進行【迷糊乳牛-貝兒限定召募】取得。(此物品將於本期活動結束後回收)"};

